    {
      "id": "claim_67c2c2451a794494b9ac030b10f18b2d",
      "statement": "The brijio entry point (dist/bin/brijio.js, exposed as both brijio and the deprecated browserbridge alias) parses argv into a DaemonCommand and dispatches run, demo, --print-config, --doctor, install/uninstall/start/stop/restart/status/logs, and --help/--version; it applies the env file and token defaults before dynamically importing the server stack, and never imports the server stack for --print-config/--doctor.",
